  "description": "<p>See <a href=\"http://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/static/runtime-config-compatible.html#GUC-STANDARD-CONFORMING-STRINGS\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/static/runtime-config-compatible.html#GUC-STANDARD-CONFORMING-STRINGS</a></p>\n\n<p>PostgreSQL 9.1 now \"treat<span class=\"error\">&#91;s&#93;</span> backslashes literally, as specified in the SQL standard.\" This makes the default value of:<br/>\n&lt;param name=\"backslashIsEscape\" value=\"true\"/&gt;</p>\n\n<p>for the ILowLevelStore module in fcfg inappropriate.</p>",
